{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Springuins",
    "steam_appid": 3644860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/c6a3ac69a62f7760300ee28bf2c238c0.avif?t=1751316458\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of two penguins, Flare and Breeze, far from their icy home, as they journey through a blooming springtime world in this charming pixel art puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Springuins</i>, you control Flare\u2014but when you collect a cherry blossom, Breeze wants to follow its scent for a few precious steps, synchronizing their movement. Use this mechanic to navigate tight puzzles and reunite the pair across vibrant, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/a03a89d70e6f1af6d67b6094a8faa2b7.avif?t=1751316458\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique one-controls-two puzzle mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite-sized levels full of clever movement challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro-style pixel art with a charming color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy soundtrack to waddle along with.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring Flare and Breeze together?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/c6a3ac69a62f7760300ee28bf2c238c0.avif?t=1751316458\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of two penguins, Flare and Breeze, far from their icy home, as they journey through a blooming springtime world in this charming pixel art puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Springuins</i>, you control Flare\u2014but when you collect a cherry blossom, Breeze wants to follow its scent for a few precious steps, synchronizing their movement. Use this mechanic to navigate tight puzzles and reunite the pair across vibrant, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/a03a89d70e6f1af6d67b6094a8faa2b7.avif?t=1751316458\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique one-controls-two puzzle mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite-sized levels full of clever movement challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro-style pixel art with a charming color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy soundtrack to waddle along with.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring Flare and Breeze together?</p>",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of Flare and Breeze, far from their home, as they try to make their way through the blooming spring in this puzzle game adventure. Control a single penguin to collect cherry blossoms that sync their movements to reunite the pair across challenging, cleverly designed levels.",
